<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="wBwb6" id="wBwb6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3ad7e4d0" id="u3ad7e4d0">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u6fb7ce11" id="u6fb7ce11"> 𝐄𝐀𝐆𝐋𝐄-𝟑: 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐮𝐩 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠-𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐞 𝐓𝐞𝐬𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua779e6a7" id="ua779e6a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7b98e2d" id="ud7b98e2d">投机采样方法通过对生成过程进行部分并行化，能够降低大语言模型的推理延迟。这类方法首先快速生成草稿词元，然后对其进行并行验证，从而能够在一次前向传播中生成多个词元，显著降低推理延迟</span></strong></p><ul list="uf88bff38"><li fid="u2aded8a2" data-lake-id="u4f890b71" id="u4f890b71"><span data-lake-id="u0aceae57" id="u0aceae57">作为一种先进的投机采样方法，EAGLE 利用目标模型的顶层特征，即语言模型输出头之前的表示，执行下一特征预测，以实现大语言模型解码</span></li><li fid="u2aded8a2" data-lake-id="ue36ac344" id="ue36ac344"><span data-lake-id="u9bbeaae5" id="u9bbeaae5">EAGLE 在训练草稿模型时，将此前的全部特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cf_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b6113db356ecc0744a571de1b5b563f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c8GLl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc96a3e6" id="ufc96a3e6">输入目标模型，以预测下一特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bf%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F660a19839e5bf648b24e1802c399845c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hkkcb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e960baa" id="u3e960baa">，并以训练数据中的特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c6908e4b08c0cbfa307f27d34e07e9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wg57Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf86ded89" id="uf86ded89">作为标签</span></li><li fid="u2aded8a2" data-lake-id="u993b2cba" id="u993b2cba"><span data-lake-id="ud2efc861" id="ud2efc861">在测试阶段，EAGLE 以自回归方式预测下一特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bf%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F604b5b27f789c593c4644f950a83a000.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22shkdN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4cdf6556" id="u4cdf6556">，再利用目标模型的语言模型输出头得到草稿词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d1b5e1fb161fab93625c773bdf5f775.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n8qyR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2c42015" id="ub2c42015">。通过利用目标模型中的丰富信息，EAGLE 相较于标准投机采样实现显著更好的加速效果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u41526ebb" id="u41526ebb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791099976788-60b03d32-1afe-493d-b248-b0b73c54e7a6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u166d4651-c6db-4fcc-af27-03d3b142567%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub24e6aec-66ef-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A488.8%2C%22height%22%3A222%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A32737%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A611%2C%22originHeight%22%3A278%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A208%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A319%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A208%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E4%B9%9D%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAA%22%2C%22x%22%3A321%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%8BL%2B%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A333%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22000F-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A136%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JT%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A390%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A388%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LFEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BF%B5%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%A4%22%2C%22x%22%3A138%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%9DT%22%2C%22x%22%3A107%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9fa0e5c2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4cb17afb" id="u4cb17afb"><strong><span data-lake-id="uce9495ad" id="uce9495ad">近年来，大语言模型越来越依赖更大规模的训练数据集来提升性能。类似地，作者希望通过增加训练数据，提高 EAGLE 的接受率和加速比</span></strong></p><ul list="u524727a4"><li fid="ubb00c48d" data-lake-id="ue1f1fd88" id="ue1f1fd88"><span data-lake-id="u23164ac7" id="u23164ac7">然而，观察到，增加训练数据为 EAGLE 带来的收益十分有限。在测试阶段，EAGLE 在特征层面进行自回归预测：首先预测下一特征，再将该特征输入目标模型的语言模型输出头，以获得词元分布</span></li><li fid="ubb00c48d" data-lake-id="u500f5eed" id="u500f5eed"><span data-lake-id="u1bbfb7cb" id="u1bbfb7cb">在训练阶段，EAGLE 的损失函数由两部分组成：特征预测损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfea%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd26746307629339333ccc8c772df278.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22grlCm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5884a88" id="ue5884a88">和词元预测损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btoken%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1871314e4fea8cf6408a3fbafddc8a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dgQVy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud97bc520" id="ud97bc520">。借助特征预测损失，训练后的草稿模型能够适应测试阶段的情形，并获得多步预测能力</span></li><li fid="ubb00c48d" data-lake-id="ua7310753" id="ua7310753"><span data-lake-id="u6a595b3d" id="u6a595b3d">然而，如果以词元预测为最终目标，特征预测便可以视为一项额外约束。这一约束限制草稿模型的表达能力，使其难以从训练数据规模的增加中获益。移除特征约束并扩大训练数据规模后，第一个草稿词元的接受率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7D%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5e57dc8e3b71aa67fb6daaadf87b143.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FCe6A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uace1d4a3" id="uace1d4a3">显著提高</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u59ff6274" id="u59ff6274" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791100286384-bebdfdb1-ed6b-4342-a097-9b5cfda5292b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufff7dfa6-de3d-4125-9051-e305368406a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub24e6aec-66ef-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A483.2%2C%22height%22%3A208%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A32662%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A604%2C%22originHeight%22%3A260%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEAREMOVAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A73%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A197%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A523%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A198%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A437%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224T%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A319%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A322%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A3%9ET%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A381%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A114%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u24fc0bb2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u524727a4" start="4"><li fid="ubb00c48d" data-lake-id="u393947a0" id="u393947a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9bdb89e" id="ub9bdb89e" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">训练阶段草稿模型的输出记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c5e8a2967fa15898c88729e81e20f6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eraDK%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f294478" id="u7f294478" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">，它与真实特征</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c6908e4b08c0cbfa307f27d34e07e9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b2LOe%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5af58b3" id="ue5af58b3" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">相差较大，导致测试阶段的输入序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_1%2Cf_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cf_t%2C%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc82e24f1474ff50f5dff3d8aa15758b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22buxKq%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u49780871" id="u49780871" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">显著偏离训练分布，使第二个草稿词元的接受率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7D%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9543afc9428a60fdd421e1c51d246fad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PJKdA%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udb65a165" id="udb65a165" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">非常低。为解决这一问题，可以在训练过程中，将输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c5e8a2967fa15898c88729e81e20f6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EftgR%22%7D" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc216307c" id="uc216307c" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">重新送入草稿模型的输入端，以模拟自回归推理过程。采用这一方法后，增加训练数据所带来的收益更加显著。将这项技术称为训练时测试（training-time test）</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u79cecb4c" id="u79cecb4c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791100346057-fe6a642a-d7d5-40f9-a89d-3fcd98777e2c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud757bb63-8673-4518-bc75-cc4e641b276%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub24e6aec-66ef-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A478.4%2C%22height%22%3A240%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A41446%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A598%2C%22originHeight%22%3A300%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING%2FTEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGTEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING-TIMETEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A196%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE-3%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A194%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A436%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224T%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A313%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A438%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A260%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LT%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TT%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%A4T%E4%B8%801%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A316%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%2B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B9%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud370a310%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u73d24ed0" id="u73d24ed0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d9da95d" id="u6d9da95d">EAGLE 以及 Medusa 等投机采样方法会复用目标模型的顶层特征，具体而言，就是紧邻语言模型输出头之前的特征。对于权重矩阵满秩的语言模型输出头，与下一个词元的 logits 相对应的顶层特征是唯一的，因此，这些特征所包含的信息与下一个词元的 logits 直接对应</span></strong></p><ul list="u70cda14c"><li fid="u2e3cf0f1" data-lake-id="u73fb82e2" id="u73fb82e2"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue08989d8" id="ue08989d8" style="color: #663000">然而，顶层特征在本质上局限于下一个词元，仅依赖这些特征来预测再下一个词元，面临着显著挑战。由于训练过程中已经移除特征预测损失 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfea%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd26746307629339333ccc8c772df278.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tt31Y%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u20af4d90" id="u20af4d90" style="color: #663000">，上述训练时测试技术使能够使用中间层特征，而不再仅仅依赖顶层特征</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u410efc9b" id="u410efc9b"><strong><span data-lake-id="udcc289f9" id="udcc289f9">本文提出 EAGLE 的增强版本 EAGLE-3，实现显著的推理加速，主要贡献如下</span></strong></p><ul list="ud1e24f17"><li fid="u292500ad" data-lake-id="u4547228a" id="u4547228a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u565dcff3" id="u565dcff3">用于草稿模型的训练时测试架构：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7be2c30f" id="u7be2c30f">移除特征预测约束，转而直接预测词元，并在训练过程中模拟多步生成。直接进行词元预测，使草稿模型的输入设计具有充分的灵活性。不再仅复用顶层特征，而是整合并利用目标模型的低层、中层和高层特征，从不同层级中获取丰富的语义信息</span></li><li fid="u292500ad" data-lake-id="ub19b2b88" id="ub19b2b88"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4291b69" id="uf4291b69">面向大语言模型推理加速的新缩放定律：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b5a20b9" id="u7b5a20b9">采用新架构后，增加草稿模型的训练数据量，会使 EAGLE-3 的加速比获得成比例的提升。这种随数据规模扩展而提升的现象，在原始 EAGLE 架构中并未被观察到</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="TwEe3" id="TwEe3" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u02f1cf46" id="u02f1cf46">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u8c18a138" id="u8c18a138"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub755f5c8" id="ub755f5c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65bc5551" id="u65bc5551">投机采样是一种无损的大语言模型加速技术，通过交替执行草稿生成与验证两个阶段实现加速。其中，草稿生成以较低的开销完成，而验证过程则并行执行。用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22punNa%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uafcc6136" id="uafcc6136">表示第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aNpIi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u170466b1" id="u170466b1">个词元，用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7Ba%3Ab%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d37a0caf92396dedc4921d08b5dcbe4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rbdlx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1706005d" id="u1706005d">表示词元序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_a%2Ct_%7Ba%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ct_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69a60168780b2d11ad93566f19030d76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i8TtO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69798420" id="u69798420">。以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7B1%3Aj%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb26e46bde7993e25545c9b7c36a21f41.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gy7kl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ued088c3e" id="ued088c3e">为前缀时，投机采样的两个阶段如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u7d90e187"><li fid="ue96c9f4d" data-lake-id="ub854098a" id="ub854098a"><span data-lake-id="u96f3d893" id="u96f3d893">在草稿生成阶段，投机采样利用草稿模型，即与目标模型属于同一系列的较小规模模型，以自回归方式生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e0YlS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50096f93" id="u50096f93">个词元，构成草稿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BT%7D_%7Bj%2B1%3Aj%2Bk%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfeb5f48b9647414cc27a87cbd40729e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TULC9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6bce1066" id="u6bce1066">，同时记录各词元对应的概率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a032acf928d0c604cf9c7204080a9bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lqeoi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ude1f9f1b" id="ude1f9f1b">​</span></li><li fid="ue96c9f4d" data-lake-id="u6b44967e" id="u6b44967e"><span data-lake-id="u0e6c3004" id="u0e6c3004">在验证阶段，投机采样调用目标模型对草稿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BT%7D_%7Bj%2B1%3Aj%2Bk%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfeb5f48b9647414cc27a87cbd40729e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gciHQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u386c6583" id="u386c6583">进行评估，并记录其对应的概率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NdZzo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc31b3c6a" id="uc31b3c6a">。随后，按照从前到后的顺序，依次决定是否接受各个草稿词元。对于词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b159c1d31b3b8a94e17686d02270f09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RO86A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud9ed6c24" id="ud9ed6c24">，其接受概率为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9dd0cf78" id="u9dd0cf78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(1%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4edf76f7db7ecba0dac836321b570f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HwrHy%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uedb66a37"><li fid="ucc82680b" data-lake-id="ud6ff8359" id="ud6ff8359"><span data-lake-id="u87ab684e" id="u87ab684e">如果该词元被接受，则继续处理下一个词元；否则，从以下分布中采样一个词元以替换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b159c1d31b3b8a94e17686d02270f09.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CTUV2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9afeaa15" id="u9afeaa15">，并丢弃草稿中剩余的词元</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u249fbf33" id="u249fbf33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bnorm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(0%2Cp_%7Bj%2Bi%7D-%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D_%7Bj%2Bi%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a6655da8744e181c531cfb570912dfd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUm7b%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u696b5d02" id="u696b5d02"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0751ab0" id="ud0751ab0">容量有限的草稿模型难以精确近似大规模目标模型。EAGLE 利用目标模型的顶层特征作为额外信息，并在特征层面执行自回归预测，从而简化草稿生成过程</span></strong></p><ul list="uc6d7dae4"><li fid="u3a271fff" data-lake-id="u443c765e" id="u443c765e"><span data-lake-id="u66b93f3a" id="u66b93f3a">EAGLE 在特征层面进行自回归预测，随后使用目标模型的语言模型输出头获得草稿词元。由于词元层面的采样结果对特征级自回归过程不可见，这一过程会引入不确定性。EAGLE 通过将上一时间步的词元序列，即采样结果，输入草稿模型来解决这一问题</span></li><li fid="u3a271fff" data-lake-id="uf479dac2" id="uf479dac2"><span data-lake-id="u5e29e5e3" id="u5e29e5e3">与标准投机采样的链式草稿不同，EAGLE 在同一位置生成多个草稿词元，从而形成树形草稿。在验证阶段，EAGLE 使用树形注意力并行验证草稿树</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2a128b52" id="u2a128b52"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaad355b2" id="uaad355b2" style="color: #DF2A3F">EAGLE、Medusa 等方法采用树形草稿，其草稿树结构是预先定义的、静态的，并且与上下文无关。然而，草稿生成的难度与上下文密切相关，因此，静态草稿树可能导致资源浪费。EAGLE-2 利用草稿模型的置信度近似估计接受率，并据此动态生成草稿树，在草稿生成阶段结束时对其进行剪枝。EAGLE-3 同样采用 EAGLE-2 提出的上下文感知动态草稿树</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="f7LLF" id="f7LLF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u12fd8563" id="u12fd8563">🪐 𝐄𝐀𝐆𝐋𝐄-𝟑</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0237f6fa" id="u0237f6fa"><span data-lake-id="ue4b6772e" id="ue4b6772e">与其他投机采样方法一致，EAGLE-3 交替执行草稿生成与验证两个阶段。EAGLE-3 与 EAGLE 的区别在于草稿生成阶段</span></p><ul list="ue0a4de6b"><li fid="ueeef82c2" data-lake-id="uc43bb138" id="uc43bb138"><span data-lake-id="u2efe20ed" id="u2efe20ed">考虑前缀 How can。在预填充阶段或上一轮验证阶段，目标模型执行一次前向传播，生成下一个词元 I。记录目标模型此次前向传播中的低层、中层和高层特征序列，将三个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G7AJo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uadc287c5" id="uadc287c5">维向量拼接为一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%223k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5b75e88e159bd5041ab615626894975.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PMtjh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udee2c8bd" id="udee2c8bd">维向量，再通过一个全连接层将其降至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hKcae%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafa093b4" id="uafa093b4">维，得到融合不同层信息的特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a1e6a754b7a8e45cb731688765c5e85.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cG78T%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ueeef82c2" data-lake-id="u76287609" id="u76287609"><span data-lake-id="u1284d969" id="u1284d969">目标是生成以前缀 How can I 为条件的草稿词元序列。仅输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhow%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22944219ad9ae866167fef13bb6f74b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ngioC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u050c0915" id="u050c0915">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcan%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a7840530f6032d52eec4663b13a7585.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZfTZz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85db8544" id="u85db8544">，草稿模型无法获知随机采样的过程。因此，与 EAGLE 类似，引入已采样词元 I 的嵌入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff282ccafaee17acec6ccafb9f68b2699.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XH3KW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd4596b5" id="ucd4596b5">。将拼接后的向量通过一个全连接层降至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VUx77%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u854c0549" id="u854c0549">维，随后输入单层解码器，得到输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JhV9E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u500bb37a" id="u500bb37a">。最后，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e3a0080e7a4923b4bcacb065e46e917.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gdqRJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c250fcb" id="u7c250fcb">输入语言模型输出头，通过采样获得草稿词元 do</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u584945b4" id="u584945b4"><span data-lake-id="ubcfa678c" id="ubcfa678c">在步骤 1 中，前缀为“How can”，我们复用来自目标模型的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhow%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22944219ad9ae866167fef13bb6f74b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fiskq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1ba1e31" id="ub1ba1e31"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcan%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a7840530f6032d52eec4663b13a7585.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22islo3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7620aeee" id="u7620aeee">。在步骤 2 中，前缀变为“How can I”。理想情况下，我们应复用目标模型的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhow%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22944219ad9ae866167fef13bb6f74b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VQs8Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f7e4c2a" id="u2f7e4c2a">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcan%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a7840530f6032d52eec4663b13a7585.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tU8HM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3e34b25" id="ud3e34b25"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5466bd74b6f9b7a2579f0303b929ec61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CUcKT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1b7e6c50" id="u1b7e6c50">。然而，由于词元“I”尚未经过目标模型的检查，因此无法获得 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5466bd74b6f9b7a2579f0303b929ec61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ol51V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d22f3af" id="u4d22f3af">。作为替代，我们使用草稿模型在上一步生成的输出 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e3a0080e7a4923b4bcacb065e46e917.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X3lDD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac559790" id="uac559790"> 来代替 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5466bd74b6f9b7a2579f0303b929ec61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ktC4I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a6602a0" id="u3a6602a0">，并将 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e3a0080e7a4923b4bcacb065e46e917.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xsryM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94249472" id="u94249472"> 与采样结果“do”的嵌入 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdo%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe1ed7cdc0648672a8758f793189da88.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZPUjf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucfc7f4ff" id="ucfc7f4ff"> 拼接，作为步骤 1 中草稿模型的输入。在步骤 3 中，同样无法获得 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdo%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6033a13611bf9869babf3d2cb215a5fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pb4hD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf599617" id="uaf599617">，因此使用 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdo%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7aa25fcc1b4b12ce914103aa7fc634f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QKyQh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6125971" id="uc6125971"> 作为替代，并将其与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bit%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc460a181b16dabebc7839ad30e5a055.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q1M4d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf32d20e" id="uaf32d20e"> 拼接后输入草稿模型。后续步骤采用相同的处理方式</span></p><p data-lake-id="u95aaae3b" id="u95aaae3b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791101464483-37b51a10-8c52-42ce-9673-e16ef14fd1a5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7ef7af05-3484-4de6-9c9a-d74f6aade92%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua06f77e4-f321-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A356.8%2C%22height%22%3A522%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A63260%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A446%2C%22originHeight%22%3A653%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODERLAYERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A294%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%24DECODERLAYERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARGETMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A589%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODERLAVERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A477%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADECODERLAYERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODERLAVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A295%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODERLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A295%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FCLAVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A317%2C%22y%22%3A535%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A510%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A134%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FCLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A192%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FCLAVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAC%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A439%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A310%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MZHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M2HOY%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A344%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A344%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NLCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A91%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A182%2C%22y%22%3A360%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A570%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GCAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A310%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A554%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A326%2C%22y%22%3A471%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TLHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A280%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ECAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A283%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A409%2C%22y%22%3A513%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A555%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A375%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A368%2C%22y%22%3A571%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A591%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AN%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A623%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A436%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A238%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EI%22%2C%22x%22%3A286%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADO%22%2C%22x%22%3A370%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22x%22%3A377%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A376%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IT%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f1ee%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u616e6b89%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4a60bc1f" id="u4a60bc1f"><span data-lake-id="u0e22bfdc" id="u0e22bfdc">在 EAGLE 中，草稿模型的输入是目标模型的顶层特征 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_1%2Cf_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cf_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F385701810e1f8775faa9bb55cd358831.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Umia7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ed028d7" id="u8ed028d7">，或者至少是这些特征的近似值。相比之下，EAGLE-3 的草稿模型输入既可能包含来自目标模型的特征 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_1%2Cg_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cg_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe993d04a4cea1a9abe08c01f0e6933c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qILNn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua30ccfab" id="ua30ccfab">，也可能包含草稿模型自身的输出 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7Bt%2B1%7D%2Ca_%7Bt%2B2%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ca_%7Bt%2Bj%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81c79683015ef29b9e15e849ef611f40.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kR5q7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue847158b" id="ue847158b">。因此，需要训练草稿模型，使其适应不同类型的输入。在训练过程中，执行测试步骤，生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZORDw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue21f57e1" id="ue21f57e1">，并将其反馈至草稿模型中，继续进行训练</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4a55bc6b" id="u4a55bc6b"><span data-lake-id="ubb0496fb" id="ubb0496fb">EAGLE-3 草稿模型的核心是一个 Transformer 解码器层。除自注意力操作外，其他组件均不与上下文交互，因此在训练或测试过程中无需进一步修改。唯一需要进行少量修改的组件是自注意力</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3e362afe" id="u3e362afe"><span data-lake-id="u036cb63a" id="u036cb63a">尽管实际输入由特征构成，但为便于说明，我们使用词元作为输入来描述这一过程。原始训练数据是长度为 3 的序列“How can I”，其上下文具有常规的顺序依赖关系，因此，注意力掩码是标准的下三角矩阵。三个位置的输出分别为“are”“we”和“do”，它们与“how”“can”和“I”之间形成树形的上下文关系。因此，当“are”“we”和“do”作为输入送入步骤 2 时，需要相应调整注意力掩码。除以原始训练数据作为键（Key）的情况外，其余注意力掩码均为对角矩阵。在这种情况下，使用矩阵乘法会造成大量计算浪费，因此可以采用向量点积，仅计算对应位置的注意力分数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u95ab9610" id="u95ab9610" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791101574344-0c354d0b-3db0-48ac-8b4a-0751911a8224.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc26d914a-dd15-4eae-8158-7125eeae873%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua06f77e4-f321-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A749%2C%22height%22%3A359%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A56382%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1105%2C%22originHeight%22%3A530%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22CANLAREWED%22%2C%22x%22%3A463%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A289%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A630%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOYOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A637%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A120%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A475%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A443%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A129%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A342%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A912%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A791%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A125%2C%22y%22%3A343%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A838%2C%22y%22%3A319%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f3f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udda88ef1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p>